lib libreadline          NONE           NONE   readline-5.2-p15.tar.gz  readline-5.2-p15 Y NONE NONE NONE
lib libz                 NONE           NONE   zlib-1.2.3.tar.gz        zlib-1.2.3       N --shared NONE NONE
